<title>USA: SBC Communications appeals FCC ruling.</title>
<headline>SBC Communications appeals FCC ruling.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC Communications Inc said on Friday that it has filed in the Circuit Court of Appeals for the Fifth Circuit in New Orleans an appeal of the August 8 interconnection order of the Federal Communications Commission.</p>
<p>The FCC's interconnection order set the terms for local telephone companies to open their networks to competition.</p>
</text>
